n and like i love israel  he's so fantastic and  i just think it was so important to show  because you know it's  she's allowed she's allowed to have a  crush on a boy you know  and then obviously there's a whole  nother level of like is he real is he  not real  obviously but um yeah i i think  absolutely there's  she's she's a fun-loving girl and she  really just wants to be loved and  understood  yeah and you absolutely crush it here  and  it makes me really excited to see where  your career is actually to go  some exciting news about your career is  that you're going to be in i know what  you did last summer series on amazon  is there anything you can tell us about  it are you guys in production  are you guys like something you're  excited about  we're feeling right now right okay  okay i actually it's funny too i'm if  you  i i literally had a night shoot all last  night  i'm running on like an hour of sleep oh  man you are a trooper  doing it um no there's literally nothing  i can tell you we were sworn to secrecy  um i can tell you though that it is  going fantastic and i am  so excited um i cannot wait for us to  give  any sort of details because i'm like so  eager to talk about it but  no i can't say anything yet no but that  in itself is exciting it sounds like  it's gonna be  awesome i can't wait uh but while we  wait for that  everyone you must if you haven't already  watch fear of rain it's out today  available digitally on demand  and in select theaters and it's coming  to blue rain dvd on february 16th so you  have no excuse not to watch this film  and watch madison just take over and  show her real acting chops it's  an incredible film i'm so excited to  watch it and madison i'm so grateful for  talking to you today  thank you this was so great also i love  your uh  is that sharp objects in the back that  is  sharp objects love it great show great  show  great show you're uh isn't your girl  sydney sweeney in that one  awesome all right madison i hope